WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:07.829
Two guards were checking rooms at Metro City Museum.

2
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:11.031
"We don't need to check that room, Bob," one guard said.

3
00:00:11.032 --> 00:00:13.752
"That's the Jade Dragon Vase Room.

4
00:00:13.753 --> 00:00:16.768
It's got a high-tech security system with lasers."

5
00:00:16.769 --> 00:00:20.858
Bob shrugged. "The boss said the vase is priceless.

6
00:00:20.859 --> 00:00:23.838
Let's just do a quick check."

7
00:00:23.839 --> 00:00:26.769
The guards looked into the room.

8
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.198
Bright laser beams glowed around the display case.

9
00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:34.034
Bob shined his flashlight around and gasped.

10
00:00:34.035 --> 00:00:36.928
"Oh no! The vase is missing!

11
00:00:36.929 --> 00:00:40.161
Someone broke into the case."

12
00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:42.924
"Look!" The other guard pointed up.

13
00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:46.575
With one hand, a small ninja hung from the ceiling.

14
00:00:46.576 --> 00:00:49.646
In his other hand was the Jade Dragon vase.

15
00:00:49.647 --> 00:00:53.327
"Be careful with that!" Bob shouted. "It's . . ."

16
00:00:53.328 --> 00:00:56.062
The priceless vase slipped from the ninja's grip.

17
00:00:56.063 --> 00:01:01.548
It fell toward the floor, about to crash!

18
00:01:01.549 --> 00:01:04.887
Another ninja jumped out of the shadows and caught the vase.

19
00:01:04.888 --> 00:01:08.217
Two more threw ninja stars to smash a window.

20
00:01:08.218 --> 00:01:13.198
The guards stood frozen as the ninjas hopped over the laser beams.

21
00:01:13.199 --> 00:01:23.475
Then the thieves escaped through the broken window.

22
00:01:23.476 --> 00:01:27.316
Roxy and her friends were learning karate at Sunshine Karate Studio.

23
00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:29.813
Everyone wore white uniforms.

24
00:01:29.814 --> 00:01:32.817
Sensei Tammy showed the class how to kick.

25
00:01:32.818 --> 00:01:35.375
The students followed her movements.

26
00:01:35.376 --> 00:01:39.030
"I love karate," Mara said.

27
00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:43.316
"Me too," Roxy said. "It's good exercise."

28
00:01:43.317 --> 00:01:45.858
Jack groaned.

29
00:01:45.859 --> 00:01:49.485
"When will we learn how to break boards with our heads?"

30
00:01:49.486 --> 00:01:52.302
"That's too advanced," Terrell said.

31
00:01:52.303 --> 00:01:54.932
"We need to learn the basics first."

32
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:58.214
"The basics are boring!" Jack said.

33
00:01:58.215 --> 00:02:02.023
"I want to learn to break boards and fight bad guys!"

34
00:02:02.024 --> 00:02:05.901
"Fighting bad guys isn't fun, Jack," Roxy said.

35
00:02:05.902 --> 00:02:11.238
"It's serious work. Besides, you shouldn't use karate to hurt people."

36
00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:15.253
Jack shrugged. "I know."

37
00:02:15.254 --> 00:02:18.247
Later Roxy walked home with her friends.

38
00:02:18.248 --> 00:02:21.750
Along the way, they saw a new karate studio.

39
00:02:21.751 --> 00:02:27.672
Its sign read, "Red Crane Karate: The Most Powerful Studio in Town!"

40
00:02:27.673 --> 00:02:29.917
Roxy looked in the window.

41
00:02:29.918 --> 00:02:34.098
Students in black uniforms with crane logos were fighting.

42
00:02:34.099 --> 00:02:36.158
Jack was watching the students too.

43
00:02:36.159 --> 00:02:38.184
"They look really advanced.

44
00:02:38.185 --> 00:02:46.467
I'm going to check out classes here!" He went inside.

45
00:02:46.468 --> 00:02:50.924
Terrell frowned. "They should be wearing helmets and pads."

46
00:02:50.925 --> 00:02:55.629
"Yeah," Mara said. "That looks dangerous."

47
00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:58.281
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

48
00:02:58.282 --> 00:03:06.058
"Uh, you guys go ahead. I forgot my karate uniform."

49
00:03:06.059 --> 00:03:10.984
She ran around the corner. "What's up, Mayor Bloom?"

50
00:03:10.985 --> 00:03:12.578
The mayor bit his lip.

51
00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:18.031
"Someone stole the Jade Dragon vase from the museum, Rocket Girl!"

52
00:03:18.032 --> 00:03:20.373
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

53
00:03:20.374 --> 00:03:24.931
"I'm on my way!"

